
/* Welcome, offer to craft an artifact, search for an item, craft an item, fight to open the gate and retrieve the tear of blood. DEFEATED, hand over your tear of blood to the death masks. */ 
@1=~(The man stares at you) It is always an honor for me to receive Bhaal's blood in my home.~ 
@2=~Did you know that I am the one who designed this place and the tears of blood?~
@3=~This is a long story.~
@4=~You talk too much! Let's get this over with!~ 
@5=~What are the tears of blood used for?~ 
@6=~Who is this Cespernar?~ 
@7=~What is your name?~ 
@8=~What are you doing here?~ 
@9=~(annoyed) Well then, I will explain what brings you here.~
@10=~Well, you will soon make use of them if you are capable of reason. To believe you could win without facing the ultimate test would be pure folly.~
@11=~He's a miserable runt with wings. He manipulated me to take my place with the master.~ 
@12=~My name was taken from me when I fell from grace because of Cespenar. Since then, my mission is clear: to rot here for eternity...~ 
@13=~I obey the master's wishes. Bhaal is testing his child. You, in this case.~ 
@34=~Only Bhaal's blood is worthy of my interest.~ 
// Additional Information
@30=~You were Kael, Bhaal's master artifact; I read it in a book.~ 
@31=~(smiles) My past is no longer mine. Let's talk about your future.~ 
@32=~(No response)~
@52=~Magnificent! All the pieces are in your possession. I can create the artifact right now!~
@53=~Raaahhhh, there you are! My bloody horror! One of my finest creations! (He looks at the blood cup and hands you the item). You now possess a powerful combat artifact, and only you can use it, Blood of Bhaal!~
@200=~The final battle approaches, Blood of Bhaal.~
@201=~From the items you must have found, I am able to craft a powerful combat artifact.~ 
@202=~I need the shield guarded by the bone golem, the heart of the demon, the flail of Taguar, the blood cup of Islendra, and finally, the spectator's helmet.~ 
@203=~May I see your equipment?~
@204=~Please do.~ 
@205=~Let's see if you have these items. (Kael starts searching through your equipment)~ @206=~The shield guarded by the bone golem is missing.~
@207=~The demon's heart is missing.~ 
@208=~Taguar's flail is missing.~
@209=~Islendra's blood cup is missing.~ 
@210=~The spectator's helmet is missing.~ 
@211=~The shield guarded by the bone golem and the demon's heart are missing.~ 
@212=~The shield guarded by the bone golem and Taguar's flail are missing.~
@213=~The shield guarded by the bone golem and Islendra's blood cup are missing.~ 
@214=~The shield guarded by the bone golem and the spectator's helmet are missing.~
@215=~The demon's heart and Taguar's flail are missing.~ 
@216=~The demon's heart and Islendra's blood cup are missing.~
@217=~The demon's heart and the spectator's helmet are missing.~ 
@218=~Taguar's flail and Islendra's blood cup are missing.~
@219=~Taguar's flail and the spectator's helmet are missing.~ 
@220=~Islendra's blood cup and the spectator's helmet are missing.~
@221=~The shield guarded by the bone golem, the demon's heart, and Taguar's flail are missing.~ 
@222=~The shield guarded by the bone golem, the demon's heart, and Islendra's blood cup are missing.~ 
@223=~The shield guarded by the bone golem, the demon's heart, and the spectator's helmet are missing.~ 
@224=~The shield guarded by the bone golem, Taguar's flail, and Islendra's blood cup are missing.~
@225=~Missing: the shield guarded by the bone golem, Taguar's flail, and the spectator's helmet.~ 
@226=~Missing: the shield guarded by the bone golem, Islendra's blood cup, and the spectator's helmet.~ 
@227=~Missing: the demon's heart, Taguar's flail, and Islendra's blood cup.~
@228=~Missing: the demon's heart, Taguar's flail, and the spectator's helmet.~
@229=~Missing: the demon's heart, Islendra's blood cup, and the spectator's helmet.~
@230=~Missing: the Taguar's flail, Islendra's blood cup, and the spectator's helmet.~
@231=~Missing: the shield guarded by the bone golem, the demon's heart, Taguar's flail, and the blood cup of Islendra.~ 
@232=~Missing: the shield guarded by the bone golem, the demon's heart, Taguar's flail, and the spectator's helmet.~
@233=~Missing: the shield guarded by the bone golem, the demon's heart, Islendra's blood cup, and the spectator's helmet.~ 
@234=~Missing: the shield guarded by the bone golem, Taguar's flail, Islendra's blood cup, and the spectator's helmet.~
@235=~Missing: the demon's heart, Taguar's flail, Islendra's blood cup, and the spectator's helmet.~ 
@236=~Missing: the shield guarded by the bone golem, the demon's heart, Taguar's flail, Islendra's blood cup, and the spectator's helmet.~ 
@237=~Return when you have all the pieces of the artifact.~
@238=~I don't need your artifact, old man.~
@239=~(annoyed) You're wrong to think you're all-powerful.~ 
@240=~Now you can leave or fight me to obtain my Blood Tear. The choice is yours, Blood of Bhaal.~ 
// umpteenth discussion with Blood of Bhaal 
@244=~What do you desire, Blood of Bhaal?~ 
@245=~I want the artifact.~
@246=~Let's see if you've found all the items.~ 
@247=~I want the Blood Tear of this level.~
@248=~There is only one way to fulfill this request. You must defeat me to obtain it. Something I doubt, seeing you...~ 
@249=~How do I lower the portcullis blocking the passage?~
@250=~The portcullis will lower if I am defeated. Something I doubt, seeing you...~ 
// End of the final battle: Kael leaves too. 
@251=~Bhaal's blood, it's my turn to disappear.Your reward is near.~
@252=~Don't forget our deal.~ 
// End of Battle with Kael 
@260=~Finally, you might have a chance...~ 
@261=~I have a deal to offer you, Blood of Bhaal. Don't use my tear during the final battle, and I will help you. In exchange, you will give my tear to the temple master upon your return. Tell them it belongs to Kael, the former master of artifacts.~ 
@262=~Do you accept this deal, Blood of Bhaal?~ 
@263=~Deal.~ @264=~Disappear! I don't need you.~ 
@265=~Find the other six tears, and you will win!~ 
@266=~I should have known what you'd say. You lack intelligence...~ 
@267=~Kael's Deal Kael offered to help me during the final battle if I don't use his tear. In exchange, I must give his tear to the temple master upon my return. I accepted his deal.~ 
@268=~Kael's Deal Kael offered to help me during the final battle if I don't use his tear. In exchange, I must give his tear to the temple master upon my return. I don't need this clown to win!~ 
// Artifact Creation Quest 
@300=~The Combat Artifact! The stranger, who appears to be a magician, offers to create a powerful combat artifact for me. He will be able to create the artifact if I bring him the shield guarded by the bone golem, the demon's heart, Taguar's flail, Islendra's blood cup, and the spectator's helmet.~ 
@301=~The Combat Artifact! I brought all the items requested by the magician and I was able to obtain the artifact! I can now summon a powerful war horror that will answer my commands.~ 
@302=~The Combat Artifact! Kael, Bhaal's former artifact master, offers to create a powerful combat artifact for me. He will be able to create the artifact if I bring him the shield guarded by the bone golem, the demon's heart, Taguar's flail, Islendra's blood cup, and the spectator's helmet.~ 
@303=~The Combat Artifact! I brought all the items requested by Kael, Bhaal's former artifact master, and I obtained the combat artifact! I can now summon a powerful war horror that will answer my commands.~ 
// Kael goes to the shadow zone 
@500=~Spirits of the night, hear my call!~
//Kael defeated @510=~Let the blood of Bhaal approach!~
@600=~Spell sequencer~ /* 
@14=~Be worthy of your origins and you will be rewarded. I'll let you guess the other option.~
@15=~Your father expects a gift from you. Which companion do you wish to offer the Lord of Murder?~ 
@16=~Sacrifice one of my allies? That's a good one.~
@17=~I'll offer him, hmmm, your head! If you're rotting here, it's because Bhaal got tired of seeing her!~ 
@18=~Humor has never been my strong suit. My fountain of blood awaits its due. Designate your choice.~ 
@19=~My answer is still no.~ 
@20=~Let's sacrifice, <PLAYER2>, I've had enough of him.~
@21=~Let's sacrifice, <PLAYER3>, I've had enough of him.~ 
@22=~Let's sacrifice, <PLAYER4>, I've had enough of him.~
@23=~Let's sacrifice, <PLAYER5>, I've had enough of him.~
@24=~Let's sacrifice, <PLAYER6>, I've had enough of him.~
@25=~You are opposing your father's wish. A very interesting reaction. Now let's see if you have the power!~ 
@26=~That doesn't make me laugh at all! Your own blood will feed my fountain!~ 
// Kael sacrifices a member of the group ******************************************************************************************************************************************* 
@27=~My master! The hour of sacrifice has struck, and murder calls for blood! Accept this offering and show the way to your worthy representative!~ 
// The Charname refuses the sacrifice, and Kael is defeated ************************************************************************************************************************************** 
@28=~You have defeated me. From the moment you arrived, I knew you were the blood of Bhaal I had been waiting for.~ 
@29=~Take my tear of blood, but refrain from using it. I will be by your side during the final battle.~ 
@30=~(He offers you his ring). Tell your Cleric (he whispers and you can barely hear) "This is Kael's ring; he would be honored to serve it."~ 
@31=~Arm yourself with wisdom for your next trial. You are nearing your goal.~ 
@32=~You have just obeyed this dying god lurking in the shadows, and I regret to inform you that you are not the one I expected...~
// The Charname is alone, and Kael needs a sacrifice **************************************************************************************************************************************
@33=~Your father expects an offering from you. Since you are alone, I see only one way out. You are the ones who will feed my fountain of blood!~
// During the fight *******************************************************************************************************************************************
@100=~Here I had the opportunity to learn the power of the flesh. You will experience its cruel consequences!~ 
@101=~You cannot defeat me, I am Immortal!~ 
// The Charname accepts the sacrifice and Kael is defeated ***************************************************************************************************************************************************************** 
